# Sovereign Health Journal

A privacy‑first mental health & wellbeing journal that runs entirely on‑device using the QVAC SDK.

## Why

Most mental health apps send your most intimate thoughts to the cloud.  
Sovereign Health Journal explores a different path: **local‑first AI** where all journaling, analysis, and insights stay on your device.

## What

Planned core features (hackathon MVP):

- Local daily mood & text journaling
- On‑device AI analysis of emotions and recurring themes
- Weekly insights and reflections generated locally
- Offline “support mode” for basic grounding and coping suggestions

## Tech (planned)

- QVAC SDK for on‑device LLM
- JavaScript / TypeScript
- Simple desktop or web UI (to be decided)

This repository will track my progress during the QVAC Hackathon.
